<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Priest Patricio Alfredo Sánchez Molinari was killed when a crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Guayaquil, Ecuador. U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador and conducting anti-drug strikes at sea that seize crews and destroy boats. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation produced 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust and nightly curfews were imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxObS1RRUc3Qmo5WHZhSTVhclVHMzdEVzYwNmphd19GNFVHcGd6UVlmU2tOTDZVdXA2Y0V4MjFPVXRLS0tXQ0ZqeVEtczAwV3dCTUVsVFo2UHVvSWpuVXNoT0k0VzNlcnNDZzg1WW50MXBIaUxnWURacHY2VFNQNFlmckJ3enh0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1PSERneDdqaGhvZk16dm4ySFhEZVRSSzVMb2VmV1BZc0JLbnRxTk9zM05yaldkZmc3N0JsWlZOeE9ZY2hFWUVMVl9RVW1oR1ZocjJ2bnFVeHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;EURweb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOYjVZRFNGSGs2bzRTa1l1aVRGZS10OHpLOFFpc0h3dXdEcjB1bUZPWUFpNHRKR01aS19SSHotRlJKOGZGaVJUSDFCT2VfMEJ5R2tWRjh5SV92MV93QmdXVTduZ19ScWw2TVVXQTVpeEV5YUZiNTRzaUh5cEZ2d09zS3dnQ1VJOUkzMEtUcGNxYU0yZF9INjZGX3FTMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Catholic Reporter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQX0hSZENDaEhtWWkzMzAzRk1NdU93eF9jaUhIcFBXeEJ6NV9hd3lDNldZVjFHbXR3Vk1EWm1adV9Rdko1cnpEVzVXVzVibmdlYTA2ekNMWlBSSUJGTUFMVFBkY1lSNVRyS2VYNXdpcVlPWXVEcm90bktpTDg4QVI2LUgweE02NVo0b2pfUVczRzBXUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;RadarOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;6abc Philadelphia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/